# Judge9-3-1

@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-First
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-Effect
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-Last
@ChangeTrialPauseMode Enable:false ProcessTimer:true

@HidePerspectiveStageScreen Index:1 Reset:true

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Miria.Pensive1,ArmR3,ArmL1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Miria Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:犯人が<br>レイアちゃんなら、<br>事件の説明は<br>つくと思うんだ。|#0204Trial03_Miria001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Miria.Pensive1,ArmR3,ArmL1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Miria Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:たとえば、<br>エマちゃんが<br>刺されていたのは<br>レイアちゃんの<br>レイピアだよね？|#0204Trial03_Miria002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Miria.Pensive1,ArmR3,ArmL1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Miria Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"なら<br>【レイアちゃんが<br><link=\"Objection_02_04_03_01\">エマちゃんを殺した</link>】<br>と考えるのが<br>一番自然だと思うよ。|#0204Trial03_Miria003|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Default,ArmR2,ArmL1,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Angry_Open02
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Alisa Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:けどよ……。<br>それには避けて通れねぇ<br>でけえ【問題】が<br>あるんじゃねーか？|#0204Trial03_Alisa001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Default,ArmR2,ArmL1,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Angry_Open02
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Alisa Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:仮に、<br>蓮見のやつが<br>桜羽を殺したとする……。|#0204Trial03_Alisa002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Default,ArmR2,ArmL1,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Angry_Open02
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Alisa Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"けどよ、<br>じゃあその蓮見は<br>いったい<br><link=\"Objection_02_04_03_02\">誰が殺した</link><br>ってんだよ。|#0204Trial03_Alisa003|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR2,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open03,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Surprised_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:たしかにその点が<br>一番のネックですね！|#0204Trial03_Sherry001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR2,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open03,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Surprised_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:やはりそうなると<br>ヒロさんが<br>殺したというのが<br>本線になるかとは<br>思いますが……。|#0204Trial03_Sherry002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1,Arms3,Eyes1_Angry_Open1,Mouth1_Angry_Open1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Hiro Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:……私は殺していない。|#0204Trial03_Hiro001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Miria.Default,ArmR4,ArmL3,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Pensive_Open01,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Pensive_Closed
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Miria Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:ヒ、ヒロちゃんのこと……<br>信じてあげたって<br>いいんじゃないかな……！|#0204Trial03_Miria004| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Miria.Default,ArmR4,ArmL3,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Pensive_Open01,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Pensive_Closed
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Miria Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:みんな、<br>仲間じゃないか……！|#0204Trial03_Miria005| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Surprised1,ArmR3,ArmL1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Hanna Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:で、でも仮に<br>レイアさんがエマさんを<br>殺したのだとすると……。|#0204Trial03_Hanna001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Surprised1,ArmR3,ArmL1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Hanna Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:レイアさんとエマさんが<br>【相打ち】になったって<br>ことですの……？|#0204Trial03_Hanna002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Miria.Pensive1,ArmR3,ArmL1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Miria Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"た、たしかに<br>ちょっと考えにくいとは<br>思うけど……<br>でも<link=\"Objection_02_04_03_03\">現場の状況</link><br>からいって、<br>【相打ち】になった可能性が<br>ゼロとは言えないよ！|#0204Trial03_Miria006|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Miria.Pensive1,ArmR3,ArmL1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Miria Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"エマちゃんが<br><link=\"Objection_02_04_03_04\">レイアちゃんを殺して</link>、<br>そしてレイアちゃんが<br>エマちゃんを殺し返した……。|#0204Trial03_Miria007|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Miria.Pensive1,ArmR3,ArmL1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Miria Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:２人が同時に<br>殺し合ってしまったせいで<br>起きた事件<br>だったんだよ……！|#0204Trial03_Miria008| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Default,ArmR3,ArmL1,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Eyes01>Eyes01_Pensive_Open,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Surprised_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Hanna Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:……たしかに、<br>それなら成立するのかも<br>しれませんわね……。|#0204Trial03_Hanna003| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4


